The '''Pumpgrotto''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Wyld Woods}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on the [[Fairy Pond]].

== Purpose ==
By jumping from a great height into the water spring in the [[Wyld Woods]], instead of being launched straight back up, the player will pass through the water and down into a small cave, the '''Pumpgrotto''', containing one [[Enigma Soul]] and nothing else. The player can then swim up the water leaking into the cave to exit the area.

